3. Predefined Reply Service তৈরি করুন /////////////////////////////////////////////

একটি service তৈরি করুন:

app/Services/ChatbotService.php
namespace App\Services;

use App\Models\ChatAutoReply;

class ChatbotService
{
    public function getPredefinedReply($message)
    {
        $message = strtolower($message);

        $replies = ChatAutoReply::where('status', true)->get();

        foreach ($replies as $reply) {

            $keywords = explode(',', strtolower($reply->keywords));

            foreach ($keywords as $keyword) {

                $keyword = trim($keyword);

                if (
                    !empty($keyword) &&
                    str_contains($message, $keyword)
                ) {
                    return [
                        'found' => true,
                        'answer' => $reply->answer
                    ];
                }
            }
        }

        return [
            'found' => false,
            'answer' => null
        ];
    }
}

এখন visitor যদি লিখে:

I want to import a car from Japan

তাহলে car অথবা import keyword খুঁজে পেলে predefined answer চলে আসবে।

4. AI Service যোগ করুন /////////////////////////////////////////////

AI integration-এর জন্য একটি API ব্যবহার করতে পারেন। API key কখনো JavaScript-এ রাখবেন না; শুধুমাত্র Laravel backend-এর .env file-এ রাখবেন।

প্রথমে HTTP client ব্যবহার করতে Laravel-এর Http facade ব্যবহার করুন।

use Illuminate\Support\Facades\Http;

একটি service তৈরি করুন:

app/Services/AiChatService.php
namespace App\Services;

use Illuminate\Support\Facades\Http;

class AiChatService
{
    public function getReply($userMessage)
    {
        $businessInfo = "
You are the AI assistant for LeadX Global Ltd.

Business information:
- LeadX Global imports cars and car parts from Japan.
- The company also provides student consultancy services.
- The company provides employment consultancy services.
- Do not invent prices, availability, visa approval guarantees,
  legal guarantees, or services not provided by the company.
- If you do not know something, politely ask the customer
  to contact a company representative.

Reply professionally and clearly.
";

        $response = Http::withToken(config('services.openai.key'))
            ->post('https://api.openai.com/v1/responses', [
                'model' => config('services.openai.model'),
                'input' => [
                    [
                        'role' => 'system',
                        'content' => [
                            [
                                'type' => 'input_text',
                                'text' => $businessInfo
                            ]
                        ]
                    ],
                    [
                        'role' => 'user',
                        'content' => [
                            [
                                'type' => 'input_text',
                                'text' => $userMessage
                            ]
                        ]
                    ]
                ]
            ]);

        if ($response->failed()) {
            return null;
        }

        // Response parsing should be adjusted according
        // to the API response structure you use.
        return data_get(
            $response->json(),
            'output.0.content.0.text'
        );
    }
}

